"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[77,30,83,92,81,65],"title":5,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[77,30,83,92,81,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[77,30,83,92,81,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1025005"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国后期重臣，蜀国四相之一，初仕刘璋，后归于刘备。诸葛亮北伐期间与群臣处理成都朝政，诸葛亮病逝后为尚书令辅佐蒋琬。接替蒋琬继续执掌蜀汉朝政，姜维急于北伐时提出异议，但不被其所重视。延熙十五年，费祎正式开府，成为众臣之首。次年，在宴会中酒醉，被魏国降将郭修刺死。","tc":"蜀國后期重臣，蜀國四相之一，初仕劉璋，后歸于劉備。諸葛亮北伐期間與群臣處理成都朝政，諸葛亮病逝后為尚書令輔佐蔣琬。接替蔣琬繼續執掌蜀漢朝政，姜維急于北伐時提出異議，但不被其所重視。延熙十五年，費祎正式開府，成為眾臣之首。次年，在宴會中酒醉，被魏國降將郭修刺死。","en":"A key minister of Shu's later period and one of the Four Chancellors. He originally served Liu Zhang before submitting to Liu Bei. During Zhuge Liang's Northern Expeditions, he managed the Chengdu government alongside his colleagues. After Zhuge Liang's death, he served as Secretary General assisting Jiang Wan. He succeeded Jiang Wan in governing Shu Han. When Jiang Wei pressed for aggressive Northern Expeditions, Fei Yi raised objections but was not heeded. In the 15th year of Yanxi (252), he formally opened his own administrative office, becoming the highest minister. The following year (253), while intoxicated at a banquet, he was assassinated by the Wei defector Guo Xiu.","jp":"蜀の後期の重臣で、蜀の四相の一人。初めは劉璋に仕え、後に劉備に帰順した。諸葛亮の北伐中は群臣とともに成都の朝政を取り仕切り、諸葛亮の病没後は尚書令となって蒋琬を補佐した。蒋琬の後を継いで蜀漢の朝政を執り続け、姜維が北伐を急進させた際には異議を唱えたが、重んじられることはなかった。延熙十五年、費禕は正式に開府し、群臣の筆頭となった。翌年、宴会で酒に酔っていたところを、魏の降将である郭修に刺殺された。","kr":"촉나라 후기의 중신이자 촉한사상 중 한 사람이다. 처음에는 유장을 섬기다가 훗날 유비에게 귀순했다. 제갈량의 북벌 기간에는 여러 신하들과 함께 성도의 조정을 이끌었고, 제갈량이 병사한 뒤에는 상서령이 되어 장완을 보좌했다. 장완의 뒤를 이어 계속 촉한의 조정을 총괄하였으며, 강유가 서둘러 북벌하려 하자 이의를 제기했으나 중히 받아들여지지 않았다. 연희 15년, 비의는 정식으로 개부하여 백관의 영수가 되었다. 이듬해, 연회에서 술에 취했다가 위나라 항장 곽수에게 암살당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10119","remark":"","surname":"费","surnameTc":"費","surnameEn":"Fei","surnameJp":"費","surnameKr":"비","surnameOther":"","name":"祎","nameTc":"祎","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"禕","nameKr":"의","nameOther":"","word":"文伟","wordTc":"文偉","wordEn":"Wenwei","wordJp":"文偉","wordKr":"문위","wordOther":"","icon":"费祎","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"212","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"77","force":"30","wise":"83","politics":"92","charm":"81","will":"65","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"11","politicsTalent":"14","charmTalent":"11","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"8/8/27/8/8/83/37/8","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1006005;1006105","warSoul":"S1003705","battleSoul":"1020705","debateSoul":"1000505","warSoulPoint":"5900","battleSoulPoint":"900","debateSoulPoint":"6800","strategy":"1002305","strategy2":"1004301;1001515","professions":"2/2/0/3/3/2/3/4/5/2/3/1/0/3/3/1/3/4/2/3/0/3/1/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"51","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2500","evaluate":"6000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"193","show":"212","death":"253","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0